<title>INDIA: India's Essar 1996/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India's Essar 1996/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  96.2   vs	1,282.9</p>
<p>    Sales	   18,028.0   vs	5,823.7</p>
<p>    Other income     391.5   vs	   76.4</p>
<p>    Expenditure   12,970.7   vs	4,142.2</p>
<p>    Interest costs 2,857.1   vs	   23.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation   2,481.2   vs	  452.1</p>
<p>    Tax (MAT)	   14.3   vs	   NIL</p>
<p>Note:Indian steel maker Essar Steel Ltd makes hot-rolled coil steel. It is flagship of the private Essar Group of companies.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
